<title>UK: London offshore tea auction offerings.</title>
<headline>London offshore tea auction offerings.</headline>
<text>
<p>Offshore offering for the July 14 London Tea Auction Totalled</p>
<p>2,200 packages of 53.50 kgs against 3,200 pkgs on July 7.</p>
<p>							   Last	  Prev</p>
<p>Kenya O/Sh Pkgs	    CIF   Offshore	 600	 1,200</p>
<p>Malawi O/Sh Pkgs	   CIF   Offshore	 400	   nil</p>
<p>Zimba. O/Sh Pkgs	   CIF   Offshore     1,200	 2,000</p>
<p>July 14 landed packages already listed totalled 4,543.</p>
</text>
